'''Clockwork Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating [[Oncoming Maelstrom (Expert)|Oncoming Maelstrom]]. It was added in [[Version 2.3 Update#Version 2.3.1 Update|Version 2.3.1]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]] increases the chance and duration of his effect along with his range. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], he can be unlocked through the gacha system after clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Stage 48]] in Chapter 2. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he can be unlocked when beating [[Crimson Star (Cats of the Cosmos)|Crimson Star]] (クリムゾン星).

