==Trivia==
*Prior to being made obtainable in [[Version 2.7 Update|Version 2.7]], Clockwork Cat had 170 range instead of 200, and had [[Money Up]] instead of [[Slow|Slowing]] [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]].
*Clockwork Cat's name in the Japanese version references [[wikipedia:Karakuri puppet|karakuri puppets]], traditional mechanical puppets from 17th-century Japan.
*Charley is a reference to [[wikipedia:Chucky (character)|Chucky]] from the ''Child's Play'' slasher series, a notorious serial killer whose spirit inhabits a doll.
*The Cat holding the various puppets is a reference to [[wikia:naruto:Kankurō#Part I|Kankurō]] from the ''Naruto'' anime and manga series, a ninja who specializes in the use of puppets.
*There is a typo in his Evolved Form's description. It says ven'''tilo'''quist instead of ven'''trilo'''quist.
*In his True Form's attack animation the Cat's paper says "STAB!". Unlike some other text, this will change between different versions.

